{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CL9", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-uniqueness}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5233064e6a2153c43282479c0ed9b2a7720e2624b9d4dd9bf145751db5846efc", "source_text": "The composition of morphisms of algebraic stacks which satisfy the\nuniqueness part of the valuative criterion is another\nmorphism of algebraic stacks which satisfies the\nuniqueness part of the valuative criterion.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2f0ace1f40b2f87fc6e2272cb0fa6edaccabffe8364d69db8eec8de461587203", "unit_id": "tag:0CLI:statement"}
