{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CL9", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$T$", "MATH_0004": "$T \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} T \\to T$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-uniqueness-representable}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:5c06727e5d09152a1f637b38d18d9118294136d51708e2b39db58466864b5e29", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9f66b5493d2e5e5bc191bc7adc51ffa29599262687f4f6139b11934fdb09f37b", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks\nwhich is representable by algebraic spaces. Then the following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002> satisfies the uniqueness part of the valuative criterion,\n<STRUCT_0003> for every scheme <MATH_0003> and morphism <MATH_0004>\nthe morphism <MATH_0005> satisfies\nthe uniqueness part of the valuative criterion as a morphism\nof algebraic spaces.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f4b0f75b0ddb4748eb1854090f20f3b53b80d9b9153788d503d7a9aa62e2f5f3", "unit_id": "tag:0CLJ:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0CL9", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-cat-dotted-arrows-base-change}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d46b0b613ef9eb9f2aca656e20aa768395749d9bbbe510821899c406e0e4d5df", "source_text": "Follows from Lemma <REF_0001>\nand the definition.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:793206dd7e99089e45b201366436fa44bb9d49b38060509e3a3a8fad9bc33b2a", "unit_id": "tag:0CLJ:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "0CL9", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$\\gamma$", "MATH_0004": "$K'/K$", "MATH_0005": "$A' \\subset K'$", "MATH_0006": "$A$", "MATH_0007": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\Spec(K') \\ar[r] \\ar@/^2em/[rr]_{x'} \\ar[d]_{j'} &\n\\Spec(K) \\ar[d]_j \\ar[r]_-x &\n\\mathcal{X} \\ar[d]^f \\\\\n\\Spec(A') \\ar[r] \\ar@/_2em/[rr]^{y'} &\n\\Spec(A) \\ar[r]^-y &\n\\mathcal{Y}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0008": "$2$", "MATH_0009": "$\\gamma' : y' \\circ j' \\to f \\circ x'$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{equation-diagram}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{definition-fill-in-diagram}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-existence}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8280bec21b47708432790ef8cee318bd5fed8b65700bfde0275c6eaf80876ccd", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:37303a3bdf03331c4422e0d9c2539aef76b24af0037bc0d078d4991ca1e918c0", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nWe say <MATH_0002> satisfies the <TEXTITOPEN_0001>existence part of the valuative criterion<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\nif for every diagram (<REF_0001>) and <MATH_0003>\nas in Definition <REF_0002>\nthere exists an extension <MATH_0004> of fields, a valuation ring <MATH_0005>\ndominating <MATH_0006> such that the category of dotted arrows for the\nouter rectangle of the diagram\n<MATH_0007>\nwith induced <MATH_0008>-arrow <MATH_0009> is nonempty.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2a76a8aed788fb50d4a670b046743e003a4511bdd8d13aa51584dc001b00abfe", "unit_id": "tag:0CLK:statement"}
